summary:
  The commit writes the new address the moment the candidate buffers.

history:
  Who the station is and whether it moved are two questions, and the commit
  used to answer only the first. A mount that was down for a minute lost its
  row to a sibling. The write waits until the old address has stayed dead for
  five minutes.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

